<!-- 设计稿「罐表设置15」：选罐体形状，点一张卡片进入对应的尺寸页（卧罐16 / 立罐17 / 长方体18）。
     下方「设备当前罐表」（#41，设计稿没有）：首页当前油站设备各罐在用的罐表，来自云端标定镜像，只读。
     再下方「本机虚拟罐表」（#56，仅管理员）：同一罐在本机启用的显示用罐表，可停用。 -->
<view class="ts-grid">
  <view
    wx:for="{{shapes}}"
    wx:key="key"
    class="ts-card"
    data-key="{{item.key}}"
    bindtap="onShapeTap"
  >
    <image class="ts-card-img" src="/assets/illustrations/tankshape-card-{{item.key}}.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text class="ts-card-label">{{item.label}}</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="ts-device">
  <view class="ts-device-title">{{text.deviceTitle}}</view>
  <view class="ts-device-hint">{{text.deviceHint}}</view>

  <view wx:if="{{devLoading}}" class="ts-notice">{{text.loading}}</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{devNotice}}" class="ts-notice">
    <text>{{devNotice}}</text>
    <text class="ts-retry" bindtap="onRetry">{{text.retry}}</text>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="ts-tanks">
      <view
        wx:for="{{tanks}}"
        wx:key="n"
        class="ts-tank {{item.n === tank ? 'ts-tank-on' : ''}}"
        data-n="{{item.n}}"
        bindtap="onTankTap"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{tableLoading}}" class="ts-notice">{{text.loading}}</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{tableNotice}}" class="ts-notice">
      <text>{{tableNotice}}</text>
      <text class="ts-retry" bindtap="onRetry">{{text.retry}}</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="ts-summary">{{summary}}</view>
      <view class="ts-reported">{{reportedAt}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{sampled}}" class="ts-reported">{{edit.sampled}}</view>
      <view class="ts-table-head">
        <text class="ts-col">{{edit.colHeight}}</text>
        <text class="ts-col">{{edit.colVolume}}</text>
      </view>
      <scroll-view scroll-y class="ts-table">
        <view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="heightMm" class="ts-table-row">
          <text class="ts-col">{{item.heightMm}}</text>
          <text class="ts-col">{{item.volumeL}}</text>
        </view>
      </scroll-view>
    </block>

    <view wx:if="{{canVirtual}}" class="ts-virtual">
      <view class="ts-device-title">{{text.virtualTitle}}</view>
      <view class="ts-device-hint">{{text.virtualHint}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{!vSummary}}" class="ts-notice">{{text.virtualNone}}</view>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="ts-summary">{{vSummary}}</view>
        <view class="ts-reported">{{vDims}}</view>
        <view class="ts-reported">{{vEnabledAt}}</view>
        <view class="ts-reported">{{text.virtualReplaceHint}}</view>
        <text class="ts-retry ts-virtual-off" bindtap="onDisableVirtual">{{text.virtualDisable}}</text>
      </block>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
